.docs/plans/v1.4.5-workspace-memory/L0-packet-W1-C-DOS-465.md:61:  - `LinkRepo::override_link(emitter: &dyn contracts::SignalEmitter, file_id: &str, entity_id: &str, actor: &str) -> Result<(), LinkError>` — calls `emitter.emit_link_changed(file_id, entity_id, actor)` after the row write; populates `user_override` per W1-A precedent (V1.1 fold #2).
.docs/plans/v1.4.5-workspace-memory/L0-packet-W1-C-DOS-465.md:62:  - `LinkRepo::reject_link(file_id, entity_id, actor, reason) -> Result<(), LinkError>` — flips `rejected = 1`, writes `rejected_at/rejected_reason`. Per DOS-465 issue AC "Rejected links are not silently recreated" (V1.1 fold #6).
